


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_dc4d9a05:



    voice "2FU_0615"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_d7fb898d:


    "文正在织东西。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_777b0bdc:


    "织的过程十分熟练。真的是什么都会做。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_484f750d:



    voice "2MI_0589"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_96a616a2:


    "圣夜子很感兴趣的看着她。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_4f55894b:



    voice "2MI_0590"
    miyako "「这是在做什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_fb1c1f0a:



    voice "2FU_0616"
    fumi "「围巾哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_f8e94796:



    voice "2MI_0591"
    miyako "「噢噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_97ed3eee:



    voice "2FU_0617"
    fumi "「老家的弟弟现在用着的已经缩水了，所以给他织一条新的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_b15e6c49:



    voice "2MI_0592"
    miyako "「真温柔呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_940d491d:



    voice "2FU_0618"
    fumi "「啊哈，只是把出于兴趣织的东西强行塞给他而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_5ad9077f:


    "说话的时候文的手也没有停过。手指已经记住了那一连串的动作了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_599047a9:



    voice "2MI_0593"
    miyako "「难吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_31a042e5:



    voice "2FU_0619"
    fumi "「围巾的话只要直直地织下去就可以了，没有那么——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_489986f5:


    "文说到这忽然灵光一闪。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_6e670992:



    voice "2FU_0620"
    fumi "「圣夜子！有兴趣的话要试试吗？我可以教你哦♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_d86a0bbc:



    voice "2MI_0594"
    miyako "「我能学会吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_b992ec02:



    voice "2FU_0621"
    fumi "「现在这个是一种比较讲究的织法——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_358aab5c:


    "文放下正在织着的围巾，"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_2899c8d0:



    voice "2FU_0622"
    fumi "「简单点的织法的话只要把基础记住，之后耐心地重复就可以了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_c4dbc50c:


    "从包里取出了新的毛线和针棒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_b7120948:



    voice "2MI_0595"
    miyako "「哇，有很多种颜色的毛线呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_3773e0df:


    "圣夜子看着毛线球的颜色双眼放光。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_db6cefc5:



    voice "2FU_0623"
    fumi "「呵呵，不知道适合祥子姐的颜色会是什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_7d70048b:



    voice "2MI_0596"
    miyako "「……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_e6f33554:


    "圣夜子抬起头，一脸不可思议地望着文。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_1b6466fb:



    voice "2FU_0624"
    fumi "「没猜对吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_7891fafe:



    voice "2MI_0597"
    miyako "「那个……猜对了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_3ccbacb9:


    "文对恋爱的事十分敏锐。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_595ba97a:



    voice "2MI_0598"
    miyako "「用什么颜色比较好呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_ae942c1f:


    "圣夜子把毛线球一个个拿起来挑选着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_38658961:


    "颜色的调和对于有颜色的世界的新人来说是一个难题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_49c4f43e:



    voice "2FU_0625"
    fumi "「颜色的事情往后放一放，先从学习基本的织法开始如何呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_90096837:


    "文这么说着，拿出了用了一些的毛线。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_9416d8fc:



    voice "2FU_0626"
    fumi "「线就用这个超粗的吧。织出来十分暖和而且软软的很可爱」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_b07d3ade:



    voice "2MI_0599"
    miyako "「原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_863fb2b4:



    voice "2FU_0627"
    fumi "「织法有钩织和棒织两种，我推荐棒织」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_19697d72:



    voice "2FU_0628"
    fumi "「因为要使用两根针棒所以可能会觉得比较复杂，但数网眼的时候非常方便，其实很适合初学者」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_f72bbd2a:



    voice "2MI_0600"
    miyako "「行。我相信老师的推荐」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_df47d951:



    voice "2FU_0629"
    fumi "「那么我先演示一下，注意看哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_08af0f30:



    voice "2MI_0601"
    miyako "「是的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_ebfbe0ae:


    "圣夜子靠近过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_09909f8f:



    voice "2FU_0630"
    fumi "「一开始要做的呢是起针——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_5028c391:


    "而在桌子的对面，低女子力组正在低女子力地无所事事着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_6ec94b02:



    voice "2RI_0782"
    rin "「我说～阳菜老师织过东西吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_50d48ee1:



    voice "2HI_0768"
    hina "「抹布是我自己缝的哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_d5973cd0:



    voice "2RI_0783"
    rin "「那不算～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_8e1a89ef:



    voice "2HI_0769"
    hina "「那伦老师呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_bc784b27:



    voice "2RI_0784"
    rin "「翻花绳的话会一点～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_287e4b28:



    voice "2HI_0770"
    hina "「那个绝对不算～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_cee65295:



    voice "2MI_0602"
    miyako "「啊，歪了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_b24f7704:


    "即将穿过洞的线从针棒上脱落。虽然尝试着模仿文的动作，但总是显得笨手笨脚的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_fc3139f1:



    voice "2FU_0631"
    fumi "「从挂线那里重新来吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_7335afa4:


    "圣夜子点了点头，再一次做起了刚才的步骤。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_4f71dc43:


    "小心地慎重地……"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_45f69683:



    voice "2MI_0603"
    miyako "「——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_4c46c6b3:


    "圣夜子激动地抬起头看向文。长时间的尝试后终于织出了第一个眼。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_2d23bd92:



    voice "2FU_0632"
    fumi "「做的真棒！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_13ca99a0:


    "来自文的合格通知。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_5c4c2193:



    voice "2MI_0604"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。长路漫漫啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_d1116bd1:



    voice "2FU_0633"
    fumi "「没关系。习惯以后速度就快起来了。重要的是耐心」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_84522a0b:



    voice "2MI_0605"
    miyako "「耐心……我应该是很有耐心的，大概」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_2fe13ed4:


    "是啊。毕竟经历过永恒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_e9852e44:



    voice "2FU_0634"
    fumi "「真可靠。接下来就只剩下注入爱情了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_db13ef19:



    voice "2MI_0606"
    miyako "「啊哈……这个稍微有些害羞呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_13e5fce8:



    voice "2FU_0635"
    fumi "「慢慢享受着织吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_04_c4d5d688:



    voice "2MI_0607"
    miyako "「是的！」"
